2.  Adjust `baseRadius` (currently 30) to make it larger or smaller.
3.  Ensure `skills.placeBlock` and `world.getPosition` match the API of your specific library (likely a Roblox-to-Minecraft bridge or a custom engine wrapper).
4.  Run this while the bot is positioned where you want the center of the pyramid to be.

